ght":46,"url":80,"id":81,"edit":82},{"width":78,"height":79},1000,670,"norway.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VoQ5bqstJ98uv7_Norway.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z2VoQ5bqstJ98uv7",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"none","Shipping to Norway",[86,91],{"type":87,"text":88,"spans":89,"direction":90},"paragraph","Whether you’re sending a gift to an old friend in Oslo or something you’ve sold to someone in Bergen, our couriers are on hand to make sure your delivery to Norway goes smoothly.",[],"ltr",{"type":87,"text":92,"spans":93,"direction":90},"Sending a parcel to Norway takes 10-13 days with Evri. With full tracking and £20 free parcel cover included as standard, you can keep tabs with peace of mind every step of the way.",[],"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":97,"version":31,"items":98,"primary":114,"id":123,"slice_type":124,"slice_label":46},"2ColumnTableButton",[99,102,105,108,111],{"Col1Content":100,"Col2Content":101},"250g","£9.79",{"Col1Content":103,"Col2Content":104},"500g","£10.59",{"Col1Content":106,"Col2Content":107},"1kg","£12.59",{"Col1Content":109,"Col2Content":110},"2kg","£14.99",{"Col1Content":112,"Col2Content":113},"5kg+","£22.89",{"SectionTitle":115,"SectionSubtitle":116,"Col1Header":117,"Col2Header":118,"InformationTableButtonUrl":119,"InformationTableButtonText":122,"isTableShort":20},"Cost of postage to Norway from the UK","When you send a parcel with Evri, you get a great courier service at a low price. Plus, you can send parcels anywhere up to 15kg.","Parcel weight","Prices from",{"link_type":36,"key":120,"url":121},"e6e7e1dd-25f0-49db-9f29-a3ddf690177f","norway.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to Norway","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":126,"version":31,"items":127,"primary":128,"id":183,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":129,"CardText":130,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":181,"IsEco":20},"Scheduled public holidays in Norway",[131,134,141,146,151,156,161,165,170,174,178],{"type":87,"text":132,"spans":133,"direction":90},"While our international courier service always aims to get your parcel to its destination without delay, delivery times may be increased if your parcel is in transit around any of the following public holidays:",[],{"type":135,"text":136,"spans":137,"direction":90},"list-item","New Year’s Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[138],{"start":66,"end":139,"type":140},14,"strong",{"type":135,"text":142,"spans":143,"direction":90},"Maundy Thursday – 02\u002F04\u002F2026",[144],{"start":66,"end":145,"type":140},16,{"type":135,"text":147,"spans":148,"direction":90},"Good Friday – 03\u002F04\u002F2026",[149],{"start":66,"end":150,"type":140},11,{"type":135,"text":152,"spans":153,"direction":90},"Easter Monday - 06\u002F04\u002F2026",[154],{"start":66,"end":155,"type":140},13,{"type":135,"text":157,"spans":158,"direction":90},"Constitution Day – 17\u002F05\u002F2026",[159],{"start":66,"end":160,"type":140},15,{"type":135,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":90},"Ascension Day – 14\u002F05\u002F2026",[164],{"start":66,"end":139,"type":140},{"type":135,"text":166,"spans":167,"direction":90},"Whit Monday – 25\u002F05\u002F2026",[168],{"start":66,"end":169,"type":140},12,{"type":135,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":90},"Veterans’ Day – 11\u002F11\u002F2026",[173],{"start":66,"end":139,"type":140},{"type":135,"text":175,"spans":176,"direction":90},"Christmas – 24\u002F12\u002F2026 - 26\u002F12\u002F2026",[177],{"start":66,"end":150,"type":140},{"type":87,"text":179,"spans":180,"direction":90},"It’s also important to be aware of local holidays. We recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time.",[],{"link_type":182},"Any","card$d8b1747e-6766-452e-9cf0-fa8ff4cd0b1c",{"variation":185,"version":31,"items":186,"primary":249,"id":259,"slice_type":260,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[187,209,229],{"Title":188,"Description":193,"Image":197,"Label":46,"UrlText":191,"Url":205,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":208,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[189],{"type":190,"text":191,"spans":192},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[194],{"type":87,"text":195,"spans":196,"direction":90},"Book your parcel online and choose to drop off at 9,000+ ParcelShops near you. No printer at home? No problem. Use our Print in ParcelShop devices to print your label for free. You can also find us in selected Post Offices to book your delivery in person.",[],{"dimensions":198,"alt":200,"copyright":46,"url":201,"id":202,"edit":203},{"width":78,"height":199},667,"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","norway.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":204,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},470,{"link_type":36,"key":206,"url":207},"5572520e-4dae-4d7f-9eef-a97d75604e8b","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":182},{"Title":210,"Description":214,"Image":218,"Label":46,"UrlText":212,"Url":225,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":228,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[211],{"type":190,"text":212,"spans":213},"Lockers",[],[215],{"type":87,"text":216,"spans":217,"direction":90},"Book your international parcel online and take your parcel to your nearest Evri Locker. All you need to do is scan your barcode and pop the parcel in the available Locker, ready to be collected. ",[],{"dimensions":219,"alt":220,"copyright":46,"url":221,"id":222,"edit":223},{"width":78,"height":199},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","norway.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":66,"y":224,"zoom":67,"background":68},9,{"link_type":36,"key":226,"url":227},"ea0e1c0a-c364-41b8-b45a-801eff107532","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":182},{"Title":230,"Description":234,"Image":238,"Label":46,"UrlText":244,"Url":245,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":248,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[231],{"type":190,"text":232,"spans":233},"Courier collection",[],[235],{"type":87,"text":236,"spans":237,"direction":90},"Use our website to book a courier collection from your home or office. Just select a convenient day for your door-to-door service, and we'll give you a 1-hour window for when you can expect us to arrive.",[],{"dimensions":239,"alt":240,"copyright":46,"url":241,"id":242,"edit":243},{"width":78,"height":199},"A customer has just handed their parcel to an Evri courier as a part of a doorstep collection. The customer is being handed a blue slip as a receipt of the transaction.","norway.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xsZbqstJ9-pVA_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1545.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C8157%2C5441&w=1000&h=667","Z69xsZbqstJ9-pVA",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Courier services",{"link_type":36,"key":246,"url":247},"06c7d84f-d62e-4864-9ac2-b580ee63ae08","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":182},{"SectionTitle":250,"SectionDescription":255,"theme":46},[251],{"type":252,"text":253,"spans":254},"heading2","How to send a parcel to Norway from the UK",[],[256],{"type":87,"text":257,"spans":258},"Choose from three options when sending parcels to Norway from the UK with Evri.",[],"article_link_module$8c909b79-e19e-4a7d-8e65-e4daad61827d","article_link_module",{"variation":262,"version":31,"items":263,"primary":265,"id":294,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[264],{},{"CardImage":266,"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":273,"CardText":274,"ButtonText":291,"ButtonUrl":292,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":267,"alt":268,"copyright":46,"url":269,"id":270,"edit":271},{"width":78,"height":199},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and using a blue hand-held device to scan multiple parcels placed on the countertop in front of them. The customer can be seen in the foreground.","norway.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc",{"x":272,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},47,"Sending multiple parcels to Norway",[275,278,282,285,288],{"type":87,"text":276,"spans":277,"direction":90},"If you're running an online business or have multiple parcels to send, our bulk integrations tool can save you time: ",[],{"type":279,"text":280,"spans":281,"direction":90},"o-list-item","Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file",[],{"type":279,"text":283,"spans":284,"direction":90},"Package up your items and book your parcels in one go",[],{"type":279,"text":286,"spans":287,"direction":90},"Print off your postage label at home ",[],{"type":279,"text":289,"spans":290,"direction":90},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or book a courier collection ",[],"Send multiple Items",{"link_type":36,"key":293,"url":38},"b53a1f9a-a62a-407e-b226-bf415ab3cdf2","card$93d4bb75-307c-477d-b60c-f6458e923fd2",{"variation":296,"version":31,"items":297,"primary":379,"id":382,"slice_type":383,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[298,319,331,343,355,367],{"title":299,"content":300,"icon":312},"Regular tracking updates",[301],{"type":87,"text":302,"spans":303,"direction":90},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[304,311],{"start":305,"end":306,"type":307,"data":308},55,63,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":309,"target":310},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","_blank",{"start":305,"end":306,"type":140},{"dimensions":313,"alt":315,"copyright":46,"url":316,"id":317,"edit":318},{"width":314,"height":314},40,"Phone icon","norway.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":320,"content":321,"icon":325},"Parcel cover",[322],{"type":87,"text":323,"spans":324,"direction":90},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":326,"alt":327,"copyright":46,"url":328,"id":329,"edit":330},{"width":314,"height":314},"Money icon","norway.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":332,"content":333,"icon":337},"Customs made easier",[334],{"type":87,"text":335,"spans":336,"direction":90},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":338,"alt":339,"copyright":46,"url":340,"id":341,"edit":342},{"width":314,"height":314},"Passport icon","norway.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":344,"content":345,"icon":349},"Flexible printing options",[346],{"type":87,"text":347,"spans":348,"direction":90},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":350,"alt":351,"copyright":46,"url":352,"id":353,"edit":354},{"width":314,"height":314},"Printer icon","norway.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":356,"content":357,"icon":361},"Bulk send",[358],{"type":87,"text":359,"spans":360,"direction":90},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":362,"alt":363,"copyright":46,"url":364,"id":365,"edit":366},{"width":314,"height":314},"Laptop icon","norway.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":368,"content":369,"icon":373},"Trusted by top UK brands",[370],{"type":87,"text":371,"spans":372,"direction":90},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":374,"alt":375,"copyright":46,"url":376,"id":377,"edit":378},{"width":314,"height":314},"Success icon","norway.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":380,"title":381,"description":46},"standard","Why send parcels to Norway with Evri?","list_block$614fb9c0-ae48-4194-a76d-a74b134bf253","list_block",{"variation":126,"version":31,"items":385,"primary":387,"id":413,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},[386],{},{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":388,"CardText":389,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":412,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send in a parcel to Norway?",[390,398],{"type":87,"text":391,"spans":392,"direction":90},"When you use Evri to send a parcel to Norway, you can send lots of different things, but there are some restricted items. For full details on what you can’t send with Evri, check our prohibited items list. ",[393,397],{"start":394,"end":395,"type":307,"data":396},183,204,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":310},{"start":394,"end":395,"type":140},{"type":87,"text":399,"spans":400,"direction":90},"You should also check the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and UK Civil Aviation Authority guides to keep up to date with the latest restrictions for sending parcels via airlines.",[401,406,407,411],{"start":402,"end":403,"type":307,"data":404},26,58,{"link_type":36,"url":405,"target":310},"norway.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":402,"end":403,"type":140},{"start":306,"end":408,"type":307,"data":409},90,{"link_type":36,"url":410,"target":310},"norway.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":306,"end":408,"type":140},{"link_type":182},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":262,"version":31,"items":415,"primary":417,"id":433,"slice_type":434,"slice_label":46},[416],{},{"title":418,"bodyText":419,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":20,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":423,"buttonText":122,"buttonLink":424,"image":426},"Customs",[420],{"type":87,"text":421,"spans":422},"Save time and effort when you send your international parcel with Evri. There's no need to fill out a separate customs form, simply fill in all the required contents information online and we will do the rest. ",[],true,{"link_type":36,"key":425,"url":121},"04bb36fb-1430-4eea-92b6-0c3eab3ad82a",{"dimensions":427,"alt":428,"copyright":46,"url":429,"id":430,"edit":431},{"width":78,"height":199},"A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above.","norway.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C6016%2C4013&w=1000&h=667","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":66,"y":432,"zoom":67,"background":68},2,"feature_banner$19e1f5ab-4632-44e4-bac2-ac4fc6818df0","feature_banner",{"variation":126,"version":31,"items":436,"primary":438,"id":472,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},[437],{},{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":439,"CardText":440,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":471,"IsEco":20},"Address format for sending parcels to Norway",[441,444,447,450,454,458,463,468],{"type":87,"text":442,"spans":443},"When writing out a Norwegian address for your parcels, remember that the street name should come before the house number on the first line. You should also write the country name on the last line in capital letters.",[],{"type":87,"text":445,"spans":446},"Norwegian addresses also have the postcode before the city location. ",[],{"type":87,"text":448,"spans":449},"For example:",[],{"type":87,"text":451,"spans":452},"Mr J. Bloggs",[453],{"start":66,"end":169,"type":140},{"type":87,"text":455,"spans":456},"Storgata 6  ",[457],{"start":66,"end":169,"type":140},{"type":87,"text":459,"spans":460},"NO-7491 Trondheim  ",[461],{"start":66,"end":462,"type":140},19,{"type":87,"text":464,"spans":465},"NORWAY",[466],{"start":66,"end":467,"type":140},6,{"type":87,"text":469,"spans":470},"But don’t worry, all you need to do is enter the right address information at checkout and we’ll make sure it’s formatted correctly when you print your label.",[],{"link_type":182},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":262,"version":31,"items":474,"primary":508,"id":510,"slice_type":511,"slice_label":46},[475,496],{"questionTitle":476,"questionBody":477},"Is there import tax from the UK to Norway?",[478,481,484,487],{"type":87,"text":479,"spans":480,"direction":90},"Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.",[],{"type":87,"text":482,"spans":483,"direction":90},"As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.",[],{"type":87,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":90},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":87,"text":488,"spans":489,"direction":90},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[490,495],{"start":491,"end":492,"type":307,"data":493},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":494,"target":310},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":491,"end":492,"type":140},{"questionTitle":497,"questionBody":498},"Can I track my international parcels",[499],{"type":87,"text":500,"spans":501,"direction":90},"Yes. You can track your international Evri parcel from start to finish on its journey to Norway. All you need to do is enter your tracking number on our international tracking page. ",[502,507],{"start":503,"end":504,"type":307,"data":505},153,180,{"link_type":36,"url":506,"target":310},"norway.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":503,"end":504,"type":140},{"title":509},"FAQs about shipping to Norway from the UK","frequently_asked_questions$4c469f65-6730-41ff-8952-2d59d83cd157","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,96,125,184,261,295,384,414,435,473],["Reactive",514],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":515,"$sclients":581,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":584},{"abtasty":516,"accessibe":519,"appPromoBanner":522,"autoDivertUpdates":525,"awin":528,"bulkInternational":531,"bulkSendEnabled":534,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":537,"enableBasketCount":540,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":543,"euCustomsDuty":546,"groovyAdvert":549,"newInternationalSendFlow":552,"newinternationalpages":559,"oohPreferenceFlag":563,"opentel":566,"premium":569,"savedCards":572,"smallParcelSize":575,"yourPricesDrawer":578},{"_createdAt":517,"_updatedAt":518,"enabled":423},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":520,"_updatedAt":521,"enabled":423},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":523,"_updatedAt":524,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":526,"_updatedAt":527,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":529,"_updatedAt":530,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":532,"_updatedAt":533,"enabled":423},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04: